   Sokol, Rebeccah L.; Carter, Patrick M.; Miller, Alison L.; Zimmerman, Marc A., Univ Michigan, Dept Hlth Behav \& Hlth Educ, Sch Publ Hlth, 1415 Washington Hts, Ann Arbor, MI 48109 USA.
